'''Zuche''' (チキランラン, ''Chikiranran'') is a [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of [[Duche]] that appears in [[Zombie Outbreaks]], [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 8.8 Update|Version 8.8]].

