==Trivia==
*His Japanese name, Chikiranran (チキランラン), is derived from チキン ''chikin'' (chicken), ラン ''ran'' (run), アヒルンルン ''Ahirunrun'' ([[Duche]]) and チキンラン ''Chikin Ran'' ([[wikipedia:Chicken Run|Chicken Run]]). The "ranran" part of the name references Duche's Japanese description, which states that he is doing research to determine which is stronger, runrun or ranran.
*His English description has a typo, saying "given him ''to'' the" instead of "given him the".
*In [[Nyanko Defence Force|BCJP]], both Zuche—the [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of [[Chickful A]]'s friend Duche—and Chickful A herself are chickens with aspirations of flying.
*In the Spanish translation of the game, Zuche is named Patito Feo ("Ugly Duckling"), referencing the fairy tale "[[wikipedia:The Ugly Duckling|The Ugly Duckling]]".

